    "name": "Screen TRPG",
    "steam_appid": 2780080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ScreenTRPG is a free 3D Virtual Tabletop tool for TTRPGs(tabletop role-playing games).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own adventure scenarios and play online with friends, which is similar to a virtual tabletop platform, with extended features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design you campaigns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With ScreenTRPG, you can build up the scenes where your story takes place, with a variety of map components, including mordern and fantasy style,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/08c4d1dd7adfa0ab655c2154bb34f69f.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can draw the terrian and adjust the weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/57e10c12b89711d8c3f98cfebaa0d98c.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import your own model into the scene and use it the the adventrue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with friends online!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own room and invite your friends to join the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gamemaster can change the game settings while hosting the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/05a8f9ab9aa5a761f5c054fefbdf4edf.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span>You can chat with friends and use dice-roll commands in chat window. Private Chat is also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/a1ba8f51c1bc956c4606303717e01225.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your character!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create characters by filling up the self-calculating character sheet. Different TRPG rule system will have different sheets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/18386d52ae8df967c6b126ef4ed7a4a5.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You adjust height, weight, facial features, and colors of the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/979eaaf0afef23d60304691b728cca88.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the statistics of your game character during the game using chat window.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your creations in the Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upload your campaign to Steam Workshop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also download models made by others from Workshop and use in your game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: The game is not a finished product. It is still under development status. \u00a0More features will be added in the future. So the game is still a beta build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, users will be allowed to compose and share their own TRPG rule system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ScreenTRPG is a free 3D Virtual Tabletop tool for TTRPGs(tabletop role-playing games).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own adventure scenarios and play online with friends, which is similar to a virtual tabletop platform, with extended features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design you campaigns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With ScreenTRPG, you can build up the scenes where your story takes place, with a variety of map components, including mordern and fantasy style,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/08c4d1dd7adfa0ab655c2154bb34f69f.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can draw the terrian and adjust the weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/57e10c12b89711d8c3f98cfebaa0d98c.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import your own model into the scene and use it the the adventrue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with friends online!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own room and invite your friends to join the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gamemaster can change the game settings while hosting the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/05a8f9ab9aa5a761f5c054fefbdf4edf.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span>You can chat with friends and use dice-roll commands in chat window. Private Chat is also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/a1ba8f51c1bc956c4606303717e01225.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your character!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create characters by filling up the self-calculating character sheet. Different TRPG rule system will have different sheets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/18386d52ae8df967c6b126ef4ed7a4a5.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You adjust height, weight, facial features, and colors of the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780080/extras/979eaaf0afef23d60304691b728cca88.avif?t=1738775316\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the statistics of your game character during the game using chat window.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your creations in the Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upload your campaign to Steam Workshop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also download models made by others from Workshop and use in your game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: The game is not a finished product. It is still under development status. \u00a0More features will be added in the future. So the game is still a beta build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, users will be allowed to compose and share their own TRPG rule system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A game for online tabletop role-playing, where you can play solo adventures, join friends for multiplayer role-playing, and even create your own story.",
